:17","end":"00:23:19","text":"那到确实无法耐受的时候"},{"number":619,"start":"00:23:19","end":"00:23:20","text":"然后再去改变吧"},{"number":620,"start":"00:23:20","end":"00:23:21","text":"具体怎么改"},{"number":621,"start":"00:23:21","end":"00:23:24","text":"这我确实教不了你哦"},{"number":622,"start":"00:23:24","end":"00:23:25","text":"好的好的"},{"number":623,"start":"00:23:25","end":"00:23:26","text":"谢谢斌哥"},{"number":624,"start":"00:23:26","end":"00:23:28","text":"那我其他的就没有什么问题了"},{"number":625,"start":"00:23:28","end":"00:23:31","text":"祝斌哥过几天骑车不下大雨"},{"number":626,"start":"00:23:31","end":"00:23:33","text":"一切都好好再见嗯"},{"number":627,"start":"00:23:33","end":"00:23:35","text":"拜拜拜拜"}],"sameDate":[{"slug":"2026-06-06-call-01","title":"18岁少年骑摩托进藏看演唱会，咨询师：刻意附加骑行意义是自我感动","date":"2026-06-06","duration":"36分13秒","index":255,"callNumber":1,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-06-06-call-01"},{"slug":"2026-06-06-call-02","title":"33岁离婚女背负26万亏损房产，咨询师：最大问题不是自卑","date":"2026-06-06","duration":"24分12秒","index":256,"callNumber":2,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-06-06-call-02"},{"slug":"2026-06-06-call-03","title":"27岁济南女想转行马术，咨询师：生存优先不要用买房转移焦虑","date":"2026-06-06","duration":"16分21秒","index":257,"callNumber":3,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-06-06-call-03"},{"slug":"2026-06-06-call-04","title":"31岁博士手握三份offer难抉择，咨询师点醒：妻子的稳定性才是关键","date":"2026-06-06","duration":"18分28秒","index":258,"callNumber":4,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-06-06-call-04"},{"slug":"2026-06-06-call-05","title":"21岁研究生总把问题归因童年不幸，咨询师：别甩锅，往前走","date":"2026-06-06","duration":"12分44秒","index":259,"callNumber":5,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-06-06-call-05"},{"slug":"2026-06-06-call-06","title":"少年博览群书畅聊哲学AI宇宙时政，咨询师：你比我16岁时候强太多","date":"2026-06-06","duration":"1小时5分45秒","index":260,"callNumber":6,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-06-06-call-06"},{"slug":"2026-06-06-call-07","title":"咨询师去她家吃过饭！内蒙夫妻获新西兰幼教offer，咨询师直言成年人融入难","date":"2026-06-06","duration":"12分49秒","index":261,"callNumber":7,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-06-06-call-07"},{"slug":"2026-06-06-call-08","title